Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: boswas-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: boswas-os
Description: Boswas OS command-line tools
 Read-only administration and status commands for Boswas OS:
 .
  boswas         - command framework (info, status, device/policy/update/
                   security status)
  boswas-info    - OS identity, build and device summary
  boswas-status  - local posture checks against the Boswas security baseline
 .
 Every command supports --json for machine-readable output. The tools never
 print credentials, tokens or key material.
